#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:4
msgid "v4.4.0"
msgstr "v4.4.0"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:6
msgid ""
"v4.4.0 adds a ``tf.regression()`` API, FLIR Lepton support on the OpenMV Cam"
" H7 Pro, Cortex-M4 coprocessor support on the Arduino Nicla Vision, and "
"MicroPython 1.19. A few board-specific modules and WiFi/LCD behaviors "
"changed — read the breaking changes below."
msgstr ""
"v4.4.0 añade una API ``tf.regression()``, soporte para FLIR Lepton en la "
"OpenMV Cam H7 Pro, soporte del coprocesador Cortex-M4 en la Arduino Nicla "
"Vision, y MicroPython 1.19. Cambiaron algunos módulos específicos de placa y"
" ciertos comportamientos de WiFi/LCD — lee los cambios incompatibles más "
"abajo."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:14
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "En esta página"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:17
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Aspectos destacados"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:19
msgid ""
"``tf.regression()`` — run 1D-input/1D-output TensorFlow Lite regression "
"models."
msgstr ""
"``tf.regression()`` — ejecuta modelos de regresión de TensorFlow Lite con "
"entrada 1D/salida 1D."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:21
msgid "**FLIR Lepton** thermal sensor support on the OpenMV Cam H7 Pro."
msgstr "Soporte del sensor térmico **FLIR Lepton** en la OpenMV Cam H7 Pro."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:22
msgid ""
"**Arduino Nicla Vision** — Cortex-M4 coprocessor support, working "
"MicroSpeech, LPUART1."
msgstr ""
"**Arduino Nicla Vision** — soporte del coprocesador Cortex-M4, MicroSpeech "
"funcional, LPUART1."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:24
msgid "**MicroPython updated to 1.19**; ulab updated to 5.1.1."
msgstr "**MicroPython actualizado a 1.19**; ulab actualizado a 5.1.1."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:25
msgid ""
"**Breaking:** the Nicla Vision ``lcd``/``tv`` modules were disabled and the "
"RP2040 Connect WiFi driver changed — see the breaking changes."
msgstr ""
"**Incompatible:** los módulos ``lcd``/``tv`` de la Nicla Vision se "
"deshabilitaron y cambió el controlador WiFi de la RP2040 Connect — consulta "
"los cambios incompatibles."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:29
msgid "New features"
msgstr "Nuevas características"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:31
msgid ""
"``tf.regression(model, input_array)`` — a new function for 1D input/output "
"TensorFlow Lite regression models, returning a list of float outputs."
msgstr ""
"``tf.regression(model, input_array)`` — una nueva función para modelos de "
"regresión de TensorFlow Lite con entrada/salida 1D, que devuelve una lista "
"de salidas de tipo float."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:34
msgid ""
"**GC2145 controls** — :func:`sensor.set_auto_exposure` and "
":func:`sensor.set_auto_whitebal` are now functional on the GC2145 (auto "
"exposure / white balance can be disabled; explicit exposure/gain not yet "
"supported)."
msgstr ""
"**Controles del GC2145** — :func:`sensor.set_auto_exposure` y "
":func:`sensor.set_auto_whitebal` ahora son funcionales en el GC2145 (la "
"exposición automática / balance de blancos pueden deshabilitarse; la "
"exposición/ganancia explícitas aún no son compatibles)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:38
msgid ""
"**Arduino Nicla Vision** — Cortex-M4 (CM4) coprocessor support and the "
"LPUART1 peripheral were enabled."
msgstr ""
"**Arduino Nicla Vision** — se habilitaron el soporte del coprocesador "
"Cortex-M4 (CM4) y el periférico LPUART1."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:40
msgid ""
":class:`machine.Pin` — the ``USB_VBUS`` pin is now exposed to user scripts."
msgstr ""
":class:`machine.Pin` — el pin ``USB_VBUS`` ahora está expuesto a los scripts"
" de usuario."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:43
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "Otros cambios y mejoras"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:45
msgid ""
"**MicroPython updated to 1.19**; ulab to 5.1.1; the bundled cyw43 WiFi "
"driver was updated."
msgstr ""
"**MicroPython actualizado a 1.19**; ulab a 5.1.1; se actualizó el "
"controlador WiFi cyw43 incluido."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:47
msgid ""
"The RP2 (Arduino Nano RP2040 Connect) and nRF (Arduino Nano 33 BLE Sense) "
"ports switched to the new TinyUSB-based debugger for the IDE/host "
"connection."
msgstr ""
"Los puertos RP2 (Arduino Nano RP2040 Connect) y nRF (Arduino Nano 33 BLE "
"Sense) cambiaron al nuevo depurador basado en TinyUSB para la conexión con "
"el IDE/host."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:50
msgid ""
"The OV7670 XCLK was raised from 12 MHz to 24 MHz (updated register set)."
msgstr ""
"El XCLK del OV7670 se elevó de 12 MHz a 24 MHz (conjunto de registros "
"actualizado)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:53
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Correcciones de errores"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:55
msgid "Camera and sensors:"
msgstr "Cámara y sensores:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:57
msgid ""
"OpenMV Pure Thermal blob temperature statistics now use the IR image instead"
" of the color image, so per-blob mean temperature is correct."
msgstr ""
"Las estadísticas de temperatura de las manchas (blobs) de la OpenMV Pure "
"Thermal ahora usan la imagen IR en lugar de la imagen en color, por lo que "
"la temperatura media por mancha es correcta."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:59
msgid ""
"Fixed ``draw_image()`` ROI handling and area scaling for more accurate "
"scaled output."
msgstr ""
"Se corrigió el manejo de la ROI y el escalado de área en ``draw_image()`` "
"para una salida escalada más precisa."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:61
msgid ""
"The IMU is re-initialized after a soft-reset so it keeps working when the "
"IMU SPI bus is enabled."
msgstr ""
"La IMU se reinicializa tras un soft-reset para que siga funcionando cuando "
"el bus SPI de la IMU está habilitado."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:64
msgid "System:"
msgstr "Sistema:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:66
msgid ""
"Fixed signed/unsigned comparison issues across FAST/AGAST feature detection,"
" blob detection, CLAHE, and the LCD/TV drivers; fixed STM32 camera-GPIO / "
"SPI / DAC de-initialization, H7 LPUART pin mapping, and the STM32Cube.AI "
"``nn`` module registration."
msgstr ""
"Se corrigieron problemas de comparación con/sin signo en la detección de "
"características FAST/AGAST, la detección de manchas (blobs), CLAHE y los "
"controladores LCD/TV; se corrigió la desinicialización de GPIO de cámara / "
"SPI / DAC en STM32, el mapeo de pines del LPUART del H7 y el registro del "
"módulo ``nn`` de STM32Cube.AI."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:71
msgid "Arduino Nicla Vision:"
msgstr "Arduino Nicla Vision:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:73
msgid ""
"MicroSpeech now works (doubled PDM buffer, added example) and low-power "
"standby mode was fixed."
msgstr ""
"MicroSpeech ahora funciona (búfer PDM duplicado, ejemplo añadido) y se "
"corrigió el modo de espera de bajo consumo."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:77
msgid "Hardware and board support"
msgstr "Hardware y soporte de placas"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:79
msgid "**OpenMV Cam H7 Pro** — FLIR Lepton thermal sensor support."
msgstr "**OpenMV Cam H7 Pro** — soporte del sensor térmico FLIR Lepton."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:80
msgid ""
"**Arduino Nicla Vision** — CM4 coprocessor, LPUART1, MicroSpeech, low-power "
"standby."
msgstr ""
"**Arduino Nicla Vision** — coprocesador CM4, LPUART1, MicroSpeech, espera de"
" bajo consumo."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:84
msgid "Breaking API changes"
msgstr "Cambios incompatibles en la API"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:86
msgid ""
"User-visible API breaks between v4.3.3 and v4.4.0. Scope: Python C-modules "
"in ``modules/`` and Python libraries in ``scripts/libraries/``."
msgstr ""
"Cambios incompatibles de la API visibles para el usuario entre v4.3.3 y "
"v4.4.0. Alcance: módulos C de Python en ``modules/`` y bibliotecas de Python"
" en ``scripts/libraries/``."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:89
msgid "Each change is tagged with its impact:"
msgstr "Cada cambio está etiquetado según su impacto:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:91
msgid "*minor* — narrow API; only affects scripts on a specific board."
msgstr ""
"*menor* — API limitada; solo afecta a scripts en una placa específica."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:92
msgid "*behavior* — same API, different results; re-check tuned scripts."
msgstr ""
"*comportamiento* — misma API, resultados diferentes; vuelve a revisar los "
"scripts ajustados."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:94
msgid ""
"Changes are grouped by impact in that order. If you just want to port your "
"code, jump to the :ref:`migration checklist <v4_4_0_migration>` at the end. "
"Each commit hash links to its diff on GitHub."
msgstr ""
"Los cambios se agrupan por impacto en ese orden. Si solo quieres portar tu "
"código, salta a la :ref:`lista de verificación de migración "
"<v4_4_0_migration>` al final. Cada hash de commit enlaza a su diff en "
"GitHub."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:101
msgid "Nicla Vision modules and RP2040 WiFi *(minor)*"
msgstr "Módulos de la Nicla Vision y WiFi de la RP2040 *(menor)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:103
msgid ""
"On the Arduino Nicla Vision, the ``lcd`` and ``tv`` modules were disabled to"
" free memory for CM4 coprocessor support — scripts using those modules on "
"the Nicla Vision will no longer find them. The Arduino Nano RP2040 Connect "
"switched from the OpenMV-custom WiFi/``nina`` implementation to the upstream"
" MicroPython NINA-W10 driver/module, whose API differs."
msgstr ""
"En la Arduino Nicla Vision, los módulos ``lcd`` y ``tv`` se deshabilitaron "
"para liberar memoria para el soporte del coprocesador CM4 — los scripts que "
"usen esos módulos en la Nicla Vision ya no los encontrarán. La Arduino Nano "
"RP2040 Connect cambió de la implementación WiFi/``nina`` personalizada de "
"OpenMV al controlador/módulo NINA-W10 de MicroPython original, cuya API es "
"diferente."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:109
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `f78d191e3 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/f78d191e3>`__, `ddf01cb09 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/ddf01cb09>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commits:* `f78d191e3 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/f78d191e3>`__, `ddf01cb09 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/ddf01cb09>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:115
msgid "WiFi socket timeout and LCD vertical flip *(behavior)*"
msgstr ""
"Tiempo de espera de sockets WiFi y volteo vertical del LCD "
"*(comportamiento)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:117
msgid ""
"A WINC1500 socket timeout now returns a non-blocking error (``EWOULDBLOCK``)"
" instead of ``ETIMEDOUT``, so timed-out sockets are no longer unexpectedly "
"closed — code that caught ``ETIMEDOUT`` must be updated. The SPI LCD shield "
":mod:`display` now raises ``ValueError`` (\"Vertical flip requires triple "
"buffering!\") when a negative ``y_scale`` is requested without triple "
"buffering enabled."
msgstr ""
"Un tiempo de espera agotado en un socket WINC1500 ahora devuelve un error no"
" bloqueante (``EWOULDBLOCK``) en lugar de ``ETIMEDOUT``, por lo que los "
"sockets con tiempo de espera agotado ya no se cierran inesperadamente — el "
"código que capturaba ``ETIMEDOUT`` debe actualizarse. El :mod:`display` del "
"shield LCD SPI ahora lanza ``ValueError`` (\"Vertical flip requires triple "
"buffering!\") cuando se solicita un ``y_scale`` negativo sin tener "
"habilitado el triple búfer."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:124
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `1dc4bea88 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/1dc4bea88>`__, `7e52cf751 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/7e52cf751>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commits:* `1dc4bea88 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/1dc4bea88>`__, `7e52cf751 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/7e52cf751>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:130
msgid "Migration checklist"
msgstr "Lista de verificación de migración"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:132
msgid "For a clean port to v4.4.0 the typical work is:"
msgstr "Para una portabilidad limpia a v4.4.0, el trabajo habitual es:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:134
msgid ""
"On the Nicla Vision, stop using ``lcd``/``tv``; on the Nano RP2040 Connect, "
"port WiFi code to the upstream NINA-W10 driver (:ref:`the board module "
"changes <v4_4_0_board>`)."
msgstr ""
"En la Nicla Vision, deja de usar ``lcd``/``tv``; en la Nano RP2040 Connect, "
"porta el código WiFi al controlador NINA-W10 original (:ref:`los cambios en "
"módulos de placa <v4_4_0_board>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:137
msgid ""
"Update WINC1500 socket code to expect ``EWOULDBLOCK`` on timeout, and enable"
" triple buffering for vertically-flipped LCD output (:ref:`the behavior "
"changes <v4_4_0_behavior>`)."
msgstr ""
"Actualiza el código de sockets WINC1500 para esperar ``EWOULDBLOCK`` en caso"
" de tiempo de espera agotado, y habilita el triple búfer para la salida LCD "
"con volteo vertical (:ref:`los cambios de comportamiento "
"<v4_4_0_behavior>`)."
